---
import Marker from '@/components/visual/Marker.astro';
---

<section class="section idea" id="idea" aria-labelledby="idea-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section__head">
      <Marker index="01" title="The idea" />
      <span class="label label--2xs">eden ai · research</span>
    </div>

    <div class="grid idea__grid">
      <h2 id="idea-title" class="idea__statement display display--xl" style="grid-column: 1 / span 8" data-reveal>
        A model does not need to <em>possess</em> every capability.<br />
        It needs <span class="energy">access</span> to it.
      </h2>

      <aside class="idea__notes" style="grid-column: 10 / span 3" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="0.15">
        <span class="label">premise</span>
        <ol class="idea__list">
          <li><span class="idea__n">01</span>A model's native capabilities are not the limit of what it can accomplish.</li>
          <li><span class="idea__n">02</span>Specialist tools can extend what a model can reach.</li>
          <li><span class="idea__n">03</span>What composing them through MCP costs, and where it pays off, is what the experiment measures.</li>
        </ol>
      </aside>

      <div class="rule" style="grid-column: 1 / -1" data-reveal="rule"></div>

      <p class="prose prose--lead" style="grid-column: 1 / span 5" data-reveal>
        Genkidama is an Eden AI research project: a text-only model, connected to specialist
        tools through Eden AI's MCP server, taking on work it cannot do natively.
      </p>
      <p class="prose" style="grid-column: 7 / span 5" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="0.1">
        The name is the Spirit Bomb: many sources of energy, gathered into one.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .idea__statement em { font-style: normal; color: var(--fg-1); }
  .idea__notes { display: grid; gap: var(--space-3); align-self: end; }
  .idea__list { display: grid; gap: var(--space-3); font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--fg-1); }
  .idea__list li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2.2rem 1fr; gap: var(--space-2); padding-top: var(--space-2); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .idea__n { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--text-xs); color: var(--energy-500); }
</style>
